List all assignees in the database.

Examples:
  # Human-readable list
  paso assignee list

  # JSON output for agents
  paso assignee list -j

  # Quiet mode (one ID per line)
  paso assignee list -q

Usage:
  paso assignee list [flags]

Flags:
  -j, --json    Output in JSON format
  -q, --quiet   Minimal output (IDs only)
